<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.label>花神使</MiliraXian_Qinghe.label>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.0.label>春水調</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.0.label>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.0.storyText>清荷記下荷雨初歇時的水聲與輕拍。讀到此卷時，彷彿能聽見春水漫過石階，細碎花影隨聲搖動。</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.0.storyText>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.1.label>花影記</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.1.label>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.1.storyText>這卷手稿寫的是花影、步法與短曲之間的呼應。句子不求鋪張，卻處處留下清荷對庭中草木的細緻觀察。</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.1.storyText>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.2.label>聽雨小譜</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.2.label>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.2.storyText>清荷把雨落荷葉的節拍拆成數段短譜，又在頁邊附上演奏時的心得。文字安靜，讀來卻有微雨入亭的回響。</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.2.storyText>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.3.label>蓮步散聲</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.3.label>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.3.storyText>這是一篇兼記舞步與曲調的書卷。清荷以很輕的筆觸描摹衣袂、鈴音和水面漣漪，使尋常曲藝多了幾分雅致。</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.3.storyText>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.4.label>羽衣聽荷</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.4.label>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.4.storyText>清荷把荷雨亭中的水聲寫成底韻，又在頁邊記下霓羽起勢時衣袂掠風的輕響。整卷讀來像一場隔水相和的短曲。</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.4.storyText>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.5.label>離火照雨</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.5.label>
  <MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.5.storyText>這卷手稿寫雨夜燈火與弦聲相映。清荷將昭離談及的餘燼、命火與回聲化作曲中轉折，使荷亭舊調多了一分明亮鋒芒。</MiliraXian_Qinghe.modExtensions.0.stories.5.storyText>
</LanguageData>
